%% One handoff, from the agent's envelope to the receiver's merge.
sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Agent (sender)
    participant C as Coordinator
    participant G as Gates
    participant S as Handoff store
    participant R as Receiver
    A->>C: handoff envelope (commit, evidence)
    C->>C: park as audit pending
    C->>A: audit challenge (same session)
    A->>C: second envelope
    alt same commit
        C->>G: run the role's gates
        alt gates pass
            C->>S: write handoff and deliver
            C->>R: merge the commit in its worktree
            C->>R: run the receiver
        else a gate fails
            C->>A: gate report (bounce)
        end
    else commit changed
        C->>A: audit challenge again
    end
